        "model": "bai/qwen3.8-flash",
        "v": 5,
        "title": "VPN proxy users limited mode freebuff",
        "summary": "VPN/proxy traffic enters limited mode. `shouldHardBlockFreeModeAccess` no longer blocks on `anonymous_network` unless Cloudflare Tor detected. Docs updated. `SPUR_TOKEN` failure/suspicion triggers limited fallback. Hard blocks restricted to Tor.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "at": "2026-09-14T23:57:44.614Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "Starting today, if you try to use the free assistant from behind most VPNs or proxies, you won’t be turned away, you’ll be quietly moved into a stripped-down mode that gives you the cheaper, faster assistant instead of the full one. Only traffic that comes through the privacy network run by Cloudflare is still blocked completely; everything else that looks private just lands you in the budget lane. If you see a sudden downgrade in how the assistant responds rather than an error page, that is exactly why.",
        "model": "vyce/deepseek-v4.1",
        "v": 4,
        "src": "34157103f238",
        "at": "2026-09-17T21:42:22.598Z"
      },
