        "title": "Remove GLM 5.1 from Freebuff model registry and agent configs",
        "summary": "GLM 5.1 (`z-ai/glm-5.1`) removed from `FREEBUFF_MODELS` and `LEGACY_FREEBUFF_MODELS` in `common/src/constants/freebuff-models.ts`, collapsing `SUPPORTED_FREEBUFF_MODELS` to active models only. `FREEBUFF_GLM_MODEL_ID` stripped from `FREE_MODE_AGENT_MODELS` sets for `base2-free` and `code-reviewer-minimax` in `common/src/constants/free-agents.ts`. Web server config drops GLM from `INSTANT_ADMIT_CAPACITY` in `web/src/server/free-session/config.ts`. Docs updated in `docs/freebuff-waiting-room.md` to remove deployment-hours gating references specific to GLM.",
        "significance": "minor",
