      "eli5": {
        "text": "Free users can no longer choose GLM 5.1 as their model option; it has been removed from the free service lineup across the platform. You would notice this if you previously selected GLM 5.1, as it is no longer listed among the available models. The change also affects specific agent tools (base2-free and code-reviewer-minimax), which no longer reference GLM 5.1, and documentation describing service availability hours for GLM 5.1 has been updated. This adjustment is live today.",
